description = "A gentle Atomon born from the very air we breathe.

Oxygen Atomon drifts silently through forests and mountains, refreshing its surroundings with every breath.

Though calm by nature, it can unleash powerful gusts that invigorate allies and overwhelm enemies. Many travelers believe spotting one is a sign of safe journeys and fresh beginnings."
